<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/assertion> {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/EvidenceItem> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pairwise alignment and superposition of the three ESMFold cytochrome c predictions" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Computed by organism-design/esmfold/compare.mjs on 2026-10-31T06:44:53.631Z from the three predicted PDB files, not from experimental structures. Method: Needleman-Wunsch global alignment, match +1, mismatch -1, gap -2; Kabsch on CA atoms of aligned positions; RMSD in angstrom. The tool's own note: Both proteins are predictions, so RMSD measures how similar the model thinks the folds are, not experimental truth. Results: Bos taurus vs Thunnus alalunga: 16 substitutions in 103 aligned positions, CA RMSD 0.42 angstrom; Bos taurus vs Saccharomyces cerevisiae (strain ATCC 204508 / S288c): 37 substitutions in 104 aligned positions, CA RMSD 1.67 angstrom; Thunnus alalunga vs Saccharomyces cerevisiae (strain ATCC 204508 / S288c): 38 substitutions in 103 aligned positions, CA RMSD 3.48 angstrom. Substitution counts come from the alignment of the two UniProt sequences; each RMSD comes from the CA atoms of the aligned positions after superposition. Stored in organism-design/esmfold/runs/compare-cytochrome-c.json (SHA-256 3a3f6caa174f4701b0b441d488e855f45ed08e61791e4f2caab650462615c591)." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "organism-design/esmfold/runs/compare-cytochrome-c.json" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "sha256:3a3f6caa174f4701b0b441d488e855f45ed08e61791e4f2caab650462615c591" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P62894> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P81459> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-cytochrome-c-superposition> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P00044> .
}
